status.init.4 = can't open the library database
status.init.5 = no audio output device
status.init.6 = the core panicked
status.idx.1 = the core is not initialized
status.idx.2 = internal error: null pointer
status.idx.3 = a string is not valid UTF-8
status.idx.4 = the core runs without a database
status.idx.5 = not found
status.idx.6 = database read failed
status.idx.7 = write failed (file missing, read-only or unsupported format)
status.idx.8 = indexing failed
status.idx.9 = the core panicked
status.idx.10 = invalid argument
status.engine.1 = the core is not initialized
